    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "赤い旗が　冒険感を　かもしだす　ピック。旗の部分が　厚紙で　できているので風がなくても　しっかり　広がっている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "빨간 깃발이 모험하는 기분을 자아내는 픽. 깃발 부분이 두꺼운 종이로 되어 있어서 바람이 불지 않아도 똑바로 펼쳐져 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "小籤上的紅色旗子營造出冒險感。旗子是以厚紙製成，因此即使無風也會昂首飄揚。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pique dont le drapeau rouge appelle à l’aventure. Le papier du fanion est épais pour le faire tenir en l’air même sans vent.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Das rote Fähnchen am Pikser regt die Abenteuerlust an. Es ist aus dickem Papier gefertigt und daher stets straff gespannt, selbst wenn kein Wind weht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La banderita roja de este palillo inspira emoción y aventura. Está hecha de cartulina, por lo que se mantiene en posición aunque no sople viento.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "La bandierina rossa di questo stecchino crea un’atmosfera di avventura. Essendo di cartoncino, si staglia fiera anche senza vento.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This pick flies a red flag that lends an air of adventure. The flag itself is made of card stock, so it’ll fly proudly even with no wind.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "赤い旗が　冒険感を　かもしだす　ピック。旗の部分が　厚紙で　できているので風がなくても　しっかり　広がっている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "签子上带有酝酿出冒险感的红色旗帜。旗帜的部分由厚纸制成，因此即使没有风也能完全展开。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
